    <p class="hero__subtitle">Lessons for beginners, drills for the careful, challenges for the ambitious, adaptive practice for the impatient. All free, all in your browser, no signup needed. Start with today's quote — or jump straight in.</p>
    <div class="hero__cta">
      <a class="btn btn--primary btn--big" href="/practice/?mode=tape&amp;duration=15">15-second tape sprint</a>
